1. Implement Strong Fine-Grained Access Control

Operating Model Pillar: Value Driven

Goal Statement:
Design and implement fine-grained access control mechanisms to ensure users access only the data necessary for their roles, aligned with security and compliance standards.

KPIs (Polished):

Implement row-level and column-level security (RLS/CLS) across all critical datasets (≥ 95% coverage)
Reduce over-privileged access by at least 40%
Ensure 100% alignment with HIPAA/security policies
Achieve full audit traceability for sensitive data access
Deliver monthly access review reports with actionable insights

Business Impact:
Improves data security posture, reduces compliance risk, and enforces least-privilege access across the organization.

2. Finalize Data Masking Across All Tables

Operating Model Pillar: Impact

Goal Statement:
Complete implementation and validation of data masking across all existing and new tables, ensuring compliance with data classification standards and protection of sensitive information.

KPIs (Polished):

Achieve 100% masking coverage for all classified sensitive columns (PHI/PII)
Ensure new tables are automatically masked by default via governance controls
Implement tokenization strategy for non-prod environments (DEV/QA)
Conduct quarterly masking audits with 0 critical gaps
Reduce exposure of sensitive data in non-prod environments to near zero

Business Impact:
Protects sensitive data, ensures regulatory compliance (HIPAA), and enables safe data usage for development and analytics.

3. Strengthen Documentation and Governance Standards

Operating Model Pillar: Consumer Centered

Goal Statement:
Establish and maintain standardized, accessible, and up-to-date documentation for data masking, access control, and governance processes.

KPIs (Polished):

Create centralized governance documentation repository (100% coverage)
Standardize data security and masking procedures across all teams
Reduce onboarding time for new team members by 30%
Publish governance playbooks and SOPs for key processes
Conduct biannual documentation reviews and updates

Business Impact:
Improves operational efficiency, reduces dependency on individuals, and ensures consistent implementation across teams.

